---
---
<section class="relative pt-16 pb-20 px-6 text-center z-10 overflow-hidden" id="main-content">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-[700px] hero-bg-mask pointer-events-none overflow-hidden">
    <img alt="Hero Background" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-[125%] -top-12 object-cover opacity-15" width="1200" height="800" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" src="/images/hero-bg.webp" />
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
    <div class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-1 inline-block px-3.5 py-1 mb-6 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">
      GERAKAN BICARA LINGKUNGAN PROUDLY PRESENTS
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-2 font-black text-6xl xl:text-7xl text-primary mb-2 tracking-tight">
      LISA
    </h1>
    
    <div class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-3 text-xl xl:text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface-variant mb-6 tracking-wide">
      Lingkungan Sehat dan Asri
    </div>
    
    <p class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-3 text-base xl:text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium max-w-md">
      LISA membantu siswa memahami sampah dengan cara yang cepat dan jelas. Dibuat oleh mahasiswa Ilmu Komunikasi UBSI Ciledug x Ciputat, LISA merangkum data klasifikasi sampah, cara olah sederhana, dan lokasi bank sampah dalam satu percakapan praktis.
    </p>
    
    <p class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-4 text-sm xl:text-base text-outline leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-sm">
      Melalui edukasi singkat yang mudah diikuti, LISA mengajak siswa memulai kebiasaan bersih yang sederhana dan konsisten.
    </p>
    
    <div class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-4 text-primary font-bold text-lg xl:text-xl mb-10 bg-primary/5 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl inline-block border border-primary/10">
      Satu chat cukup untuk memulai perubahan.
    </div>
    
    <div class="hero-anim hero-anim-delay-5 flex flex-col w-full sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center max-w-md mx-auto">
      <a href="/chat" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-variant text-white font-bold rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group active:scale-95">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">chat</span>
        <span>Mulai Chat</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#csr" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-surface-container hover:bg-outline-variant/30 text-primary font-bold rounded-full transition-all border border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 active:scale-95">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">volunteer_activism</span>
        <span>Program CSR</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
